akout is the source alternative.','conditions':['Candidate analogue transmission; digital failure-mode obligations remain outside this selected variant.'],'numeric':[],'checks':'Inspect each channel\'s direct signal route and detachable connector. During technical inspection disconnect each channel independently and demonstrate the monitor and inhibit functions.','source_refs':[['clause_id':'FSAE-2027-V1:T.4.2.7:p001','source_rule_id':'T.4.2.7','source_sha256':'f71df5552e341dab1b58f1ff47212e7281953d66b9c41833de8347560913ed0e','source_text_sha256':'1e4e4c1442dd2b7b6cf14456315cbb50e60ea6a7443b3a61ff731b0746e325e3','source_pages':[67]],['clause_id':'FSAE-2027-V1:T.4.2.7:p002','source_rule_id':'T.4.2.7','source_sha256':'f71df5552e341dab1b58f1ff47212e7281953d66b9c41833de8347560913ed0e','source_text_sha256':'4a99772ed9c5a005b47cd3292884ff3d42593d975512e725f9802a479a614e2e','source_pages':[67]],['clause_id':'FSAE-2027-V1:T.4.2.7:p003','source_rule_id':'T.4.2.7','source_sha256':'f71df5552e341dab1b58f1ff47212e7281953d66b9c41833de8347560913ed0e','source_text_sha256':'7f50a19f437fdc27c63778f7650ceb1d65735742ac76cc283097d0f9634cab3f','source_pages':[67]],['clause_id':'FSAE-2027-V1:T.4.2.8:p001','source_rule_id':'T.4.2.8','source_sha256':'f71df5552e341dab1b58f1ff47212e7281953d66b9c41833de8347560913ed0e','source_text_sha256':'25ad32de4bc2d97020ac7e42b4334ea4e6047af0ee0efe377820500ac5ffd007','source_pages':[67]]],'classification':'design_and_inspection_process','interpretation_status':'interpreted_candidate','coverage_status':'prepared_not_applied','verification_method':'inspection_review_and_fault_injection','verification_status':'not_verified','evidence_status':'not_available','compliance_status':'not_claimed','conditions_json':'["Candidate analogue transmission; digital failure-mode obligations remain outside this selected variant."]','numeric_json':'[]','source_ids_json':'["FSAE-2027-V1:T.4.2.7:p001","FSAE-2027-V1:T.4.2.7:p002","FSAE-2027-V1:T.4.2.7:p003","FSAE-2027-V1:T.4.2.8:p001"]'],['id':'DD-07','title':'Measure brake demand','rules':['T.4.3.1'],'functions':['brake-input'],'owner':'braking / driver-demand sensing','statement':'Provide a brake pedal-position or brake-pressure sensor/switch. This candidate models brake-pressure sensing without selecting a physical pressure threshold or hardware rating.','conditions':['Brake encoder candidate; hard-braking and mechanical-brake-engagement criteria must be substantiated separately.'],'numeric':[],'checks':'Inspect the selected sensing principle and calibrate its relation to brake demand. Establish the mechanical-brake-engagement and hard-braking criteria from the actual brake design; record supporting evidence.','source_refs':[['clause_id':'FSAE-2027-V1:T.4.3.1:p001','source_rule_id':'T.4.3.1','source_sha256':'f71df5552e341dab1b58f1ff47212e7281953d66b9c41833de8347560913ed0e','source_text_sha256':'1734a04d85bc065b9183a66abd315b134f2a71a7c3add68ad8fa072a9f328062','source_pages':[68]]],'classification':'technical_design_and_verification','interpretation_status':'interpreted_candidate','coverage_status':'prepared_not_applied','verification_method':'inspection_review_and_fault_injection','verification_status':'not_verified','evidence_status':'not_available','compliance_status':'not_claimed','conditions_json':'["Brake encoder candidate; hard-braking and mechanical-brake-engagement criteria must be substantiated separately."]','numeric_json':'[]','source_ids_json':'["FSAE-2027-V1:T.4.3.1:p001"]'],['id':'DD-08','title':'Detect BSE faults and inhibit motor power','rules':['T.4.3.3','T.4.3.4'],'functions':['brake-input','brake-fault','motor-inhibit'],'owner':'braking sensor / driver-demand monitor / powertrain','statement':'Send BSE signals directly to a controller through an allowed path. Detect sensor/wiring faults persisting longer than one hundred milliseconds, treat them as implausibility and immediately stop all motor power. EV motor-controller power removal is sufficient; complete tractive-system deactivation is not required by this clause. For the analogue candidate detect open/short signals outside its actual operating range, with bias resistors ensuring open-circuit detection. Source example 0.5/4.5 V values are not adopted as hardware limits.','conditions':['Candidate analogue BSE. Digital BSE requirements and its form applicability remain unallocated.'],'numeric':[['quantity':'BSE fault persistence','value':100,'unit':'ms','operator':'>'],['quantity':'illustrative analogue fault range','lower':0.5,'upper':4.5,'unit':'V','role':'source example only']],'checks':'Inspect direct routing and bias circuitry. Fault-inject each open, short, out-of-range and wiring failure; check persistence boundaries and complete motor-power removal. Establish actual sensor ranges and detection coverage.','source_refs':[['clause_id':'FSAE-2027-V1:T.4.3.3:p001','source_rule_id':'T.4.3.3','source_sha256':'f71df5552e341dab1b58f1ff47212e7281953d66b9c41833de8347560913ed0e','source_text_sha256':'0a03705592b0d2e44f08038c39cd82c61eea581eeb44d1c2de4bfb6b2d48ef8d','source_pages':[68]],['clause_id':'FSAE-2027-V1:T.4.3.3:p002','source_rule_id':'T.4.3.3','source_sha256':'f71df5552e341dab1b58f1ff47212e7281953d66b9c41833de8347560913ed0e','source_text_sha256':'934709ca5bfefe3968b966d454469198dc3de30960fa0f4d28b4cb7ddab74df3','source_pages':[68]],['clause_id':'FSAE-2027-V1:T.4.3.3:p003','source_rule_id':'T.4.3.3','source_sha256':'f71df5552e341dab1b58f1ff47212e7281953d66b9c41833de8347560913ed0e','source_text_sha256':'4206adbdbe7cfc758523d6ee16e3a576fdfddbc89da80f8eb0f0a6bb602ffefa','source_pages':[68]],['clause_id':'FSAE-2027-V1:T.4.3.4:p001','source_rule_id':'T.4.3.4','source_sha256':'f71df5552e341dab1b58f1ff47212e7281953d66b9c41833de8347560913ed0e','source_text_sha256':'90bd84f581f91761af061a1ae20b81dfede665ab6b76bb2453f5064c8a302782','source_pages':[68]],['clause_id':'FSAE-2027-V1:T.4.3.4:p002','source_rule_id':'T.4.3.4','source_sha256':'f71df5552e341dab1b58f1ff47212e7281953d66b9c41833